      "message": "Yeah, just for the host-based unit tests.\n\nAt a larger scope, what other tests are using CONFIG_FPU? Is their behavior correct without these flags? Does the behavior on the host with these flags match what happens on the target hardware (which doesn\u0027t have SSE or x64 instructions)?",
