      "lineNbr": 20,
      "author": {
        "id": 1330845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-02T19:41:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What different environments do you presume we\u0027ll need to run in?\n\nWould still vote for compare with tolerance here.",
      "parentUuid": "138c1f42_5521d2f5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
        "startChar": 39,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "be3836a30aa2813c88e726a682ad73d6ebbf07da",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "dc12290f_227de02d",
        "filename": "zephyr/test/accel_cal/CMakeLists.txt",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 20,
      "author": {
        "id": 1333748
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-02T23:00:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Even just ticking the compiler version might break this. No guarantee that the next version of Clang won\u0027t break. Seems safer to just restrict. I\u0027d hate to hunt this down 5 years from now on an uprev of the toolchain.",
      "parentUuid": "1c7bcdba_9f4ae536",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
        "startChar": 39,
        "endLine": 20,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "be3836a30aa2813c88e726a682ad73d6ebbf07da",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
